00:04:43,199 --> 00:04:49,199
Love who you want. It's good foreign policy.

2
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:32,399
Red, White & Royal Blue is a comedy, romance film directed by Matthew López.

3
00:14:09,599 --> 00:14:15,599
After an altercation between Alex, the president's son, and Britain's Prince Henry at a royal event becomes
tabloid fodder, their long-running feud now threatens to drive a wedge in U.S./British relations.

4
00:18:52,799 --> 00:18:58,799
When the rivals are forced into a staged truce, their icy relationship begins to thaw and
the friction between them sparks something deeper than they ever expected.

5
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:42,000
Alex Claremont-Diaz, played by Taylor Zakhar Perez.

6
00:28:19,199 --> 00:28:25,199
Henry Hanover-Stuart Fox, played by Nicholas Galitzine.

7
00:33:02,399 --> 00:33:08,399
Ellen Claremont, played by Uma Thurman.

8
00:37:45,599 --> 00:37:51,599
Oscar Diaz, played by Clifton Collins Jr..

9
00:42:28,799 --> 00:42:34,799
Nora Holleran, played by Rachel Hilson.

10
00:47:12,000 --> 00:47:18,000
Zahra Bankston, played by Sarah Shahi.

11
00:51:55,199 --> 00:52:01,199
Red, White & Royal Blue is a 2023 American romantic comedy film directed by Matthew López in his
feature film directorial debut, from a screenplay that he co-wrote with Ted Malawer.

12
00:56:38,399 --> 00:56:44,399
The script is based on the 2019 novel by Casey McQuiston; it depicts a developing love affair between the son of
the president of the United States (Taylor Zakhar Perez) and a British prince (Nicholas Galitzine).

13
01:01:21,599 --> 01:01:27,599
Clifton Collins Jr., Sarah Shahi, Rachel Hilson, Stephen Fry,
and Uma Thurman appear in supporting roles.

14
01:06:04,799 --> 01:06:10,799
In 2019, Amazon Studios announced the film's
development with Greg Berlanti as a producer.

15
01:10:48,000 --> 01:10:54,000
López was announced as director and co-writer with Malawer in 2021.

16
01:15:31,199 --> 01:15:37,199
Casting announcements began in June 2022 with Zakhar Perez, Galitzine
and Thurman announced to play their respective roles.

17
01:20:14,399 --> 01:20:20,399
The majority of the remaining cast was announced the following month.

18
01:24:57,599 --> 01:25:03,599
Filming took place in England between June and August 2022.

19
01:29:40,800 --> 01:29:46,800
Red, White & Royal Blue premiered at the BFI IMAX in London on July 22,
2023, and was released on Amazon Prime Video on August 11.

20
01:34:24,000 --> 01:34:30,000
It received positive reviews from critics, and was nominated for
Outstanding Television Movie at the 76th Primetime Emmy Awards.

21
01:39:07,199 --> 01:39:13,199
It is the last film released under the Amazon Studios name before the
studio was rebranded as Amazon MGM Studios a month later.

22
01:43:50,399 --> 01:43:56,399
A sequel, Red, White & Royal Wedding, is in development with
Zakhar Perez and Galitzine set to return.

23
01:48:33,599 --> 01:48:39,599
The film explores themes of based on novel or book,
politics, prince, royal family, royalty.

24
01:53:16,799 --> 01:53:22,799
The tone is lighthearted and emotional and thought_provoking.
